--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: emit::leaf
visibility: public
---
// Two steps from `secret`'s author, and across a scope boundary, so it does
// not arrive. The inclusion is compositional: Leaf has a Mixin and is not one,
// so no `is_a` edge is created by it (D4.1).
Leaf: !node &Leaf
  extends: ../mid/Mid
  <<: ../base/Mixin
  pub name: leaf
